  "term": "Desoxyn",
  "definition": "Desoxyn is a brand name for methamphetamine hydrochloride, a stimulant that increases brain levels of noradrenaline and dopamine by promoting their release and blocking their reuptake. This can raise alertness and activity, produce euphoria and excitement, suppress appetite, and can also lead to dependence.",
